  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive). Pattern: X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{咲|さ}く (X blooms).\n\nASPECT: {咲|さ}いて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates flowers are currently in bloom.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{桜|さくら}→桜：02212_sakura⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{咲|さ}く (cherry blossoms bloom)\n- ⟦{花|はな}→花：00523_hana⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{咲|さ}く (flowers bloom)\n- ⟦{満開|まんかい}→満開：13319_mankai⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{咲|さ}く (bloom in full)\n- {綺麗|きれい}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{咲|さ}く (bloom beautifully)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{笑顔|えがお}→笑顔：01884_egao⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{咲|さ}く (a smile blooms/breaks out)\n- {話|はな}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{花|はな}→花：00523_hana⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{咲|さ}く (conversation flourishes)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{散|ち}る→散る：02075_chiru⟧ (to fall/scatter - for petals)",
